  "notes": [
    "These numbers are a measurement and not a balance claim: release-plan.md forbids any balance claim before 0.5.0. The universe remains degenerate, and this sweep measured how: five of the eight pool strategies -- passive-control, uniform-random-legal, archivist, portal-rush and worship-maximizer -- end at identical achievement vectors of 12 mastered cells, 51 nodes known and 12 cells spanned, so they submit different actions and produce the same universe. permissive-breadth is the only strategy whose play moves any measured quantity, which is why it takes 100 percent of the wins here. That is a property of the pool and of the two missing loops (universities do not compound into a rate; nothing is ever the last copy, so libraryDependence is identically zero), not of the win condition."
